From: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 12:22:30 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Revert "mm: thp: restore SHRINKER_NONSLAB on the deferred
 split shrinker"

This reverts commit 33d80d12f1340f112e06e3f27d421f44f0df5a7d.

Signed-off-by: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
---
 mm/huge_memory.c | 3 +--
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/mm/huge_memory.c b/mm/huge_memory.c
index 29538d81f91d..ddc631a388b9 100644
--- a/mm/huge_memory.c
+++ b/mm/huge_memory.c
@@ -1059,8 +1059,7 @@ int folio_memcg_alloc_deferred(struct folio *folio)
 static int __init thp_shrinker_init(void)
 {
 	deferred_split_shrinker = shrinker_alloc(SHRINKER_NUMA_AWARE |
-						 SHRINKER_MEMCG_AWARE |
-						 SHRINKER_NONSLAB,
+						 SHRINKER_MEMCG_AWARE,
 						 "thp-deferred_split");
 	if (!deferred_split_shrinker)
 		return -ENOMEM;
-- 
2.47.3

